WEBVTT

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.720
wa vizazi vya watu

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:07.456
walioamini kwenye ahadi ya Marekani

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:11.920
na walikua na imani ya kujenga zaidi
demokrasia?

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:21.416
Unataka kuishi kwenye
uwezo wako kamili?

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.016
Ndio kabisa.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.760
Na ninaamini ungependa pia.

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.056
Wacha niseme tu, kwa uzito kabisa,